<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβαρις</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾶρις</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>having no boat, landsman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβαριστάν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικιζομένην</span> (<i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβαρκνᾷ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομᾶ</span> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>), but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβαρκνα:</span></b> 
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμός,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβαρλεῖται:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταράσσεται, κροτεῖ,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβάρνου:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στένε,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβαρταί</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτηναί</span>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβαρύ</span></b> ,
				=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ο&lt;&gt;ρίγανον</span> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβάς:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐήθης;</span> also 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερὰ νόσος</span>
			 (
				Tarent.
			), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβάσαι:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστῆσαι, καὶ ἀρθῆναι,</span>
		Id.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
